DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Hi Gayathri\, Hi Farhan\,\n\nSetting up this dis
 cussion with Steven for the role of .Net API developer in our projects. Pl
 s see attached Steven's profile.\n\n\nSteven Ramirez:\nSteven Ramirez is a
  highly experienced Senior Full Stack and Application Architect with over 
 25 years in software development\, specializing in .NET API development an
 d cloud-native enterprise solutions. He has extensive expertise in designi
 ng scalable systems and leading Agile teams across various industries.\n\n
   *\nSenior Full Stack / Application Architect with 20+ years of experienc
 e delivering large-scale enterprise web and cloud-native solutions across 
 financial services\, education\, and betting domains.\n  *\nStrong experti
 se in .NET (C#)\, Java\, RESTful APIs\, SOAP\, GraphQL\, and microservices
  architecture\, with deep experience designing scalable API-driven systems
  and integration layers.\n  *\nExtensive hands-on experience with Azure cl
 oud services including API Management\, Functions\, Logic Apps\, Web Apps\
 , and CI/CD pipelines using Azure DevOps\, Jenkins\, and GitHub Actions.\n
   *\nProven background in architecting and delivering enterprise web platf
 orms using modern front-end technologies (React\, Angular\, Next.js\, Java
 Script\, HTML/CSS) integrated with backend services.\n  *\nStrong database
  and integration experience across SQL Server\, Oracle\, PostgreSQL\, and 
 data migration/optimisation\, including performance tuning and large-scale
  system modernisation.\n  *\nDemonstrated leadership in DevSecOps\, Agile 
 delivery\, system architecture governance\, and cloud migration\, with add
 itional exposure to AI/GenAI solutions using OpenAI\, LangChain\, and RAG-
 based systems.\n\n\nRegards\,\nDarshan\n\n________________________________
